OL,3,GNEWSABristol Greens leader opposes
OL,4,Aanti-Zionism vote
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motion has been condemned by some
OL,7,FJewish groups, who called it an "attack
OL,8,Fon the Jewish community", as well as
OL,9,Fseveral MPs.
